+      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="welcome"><div><div class="eyebrow">A FRESH START, TOGETHER.</div><h1 id="welcome">新同事，欢迎加入。</h1><p>很高兴与你开启新的旅程。这里准备了你第一周需要的一切，<br>跟着自己的节奏，一步步熟悉新的工作与伙伴。</p><div class="hero-tags"><span><i>✓</i> 一份清晰的入职计划</span><span><i>✓</i> 触手可及的工作资源</span><span><i>✓</i> 随时陪伴的团队</span></div></div><div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit"></div><div class="plant"><div class="stem"></div><div class="leaf"></div><div class="leaf right"></div><div class="leaf low"></div><div class="pot"></div></div><span class="spark">✧</span><span class="art-note">Room to grow.</span></div></section>
